=== real finding: manual 'kubectl scale --replicas=1' was overridden back to 2 ===
HPA (minReplicas=2) continuously reconciles and wins over a one-off manual kubectl scale -
the endpoints list never dropped to 1 because the HPA controller's next sync cycle re-asserted
its desired replica count. Real, valuable lesson: HPA and manual scaling are not independent;
HPA will fight and override manual scaling on every reconcile loop while it's active.

